I&#39;m not really seeing the relation between knowing what is coming and Master of Magic.&nbsp;Since the healing is based on the card that is played rather than what is revealed. DW NightMist&#39;s potential seems to be casting much more powerful spells

[/quote]

I think the connection is that since you&#39;re focusing on casting spells, it&#39;s useful to have lined up good magic point values for those spells. Plus, by stacking the deck, you get to draw the top one, giving you a much better chance of having the spell you want, including having a spell with a high magic value so you gain more hit points.
